{"text": "BALOGUN & THACKERAY CPAs -- workpaper note\nClient: Mistry / Falk household        Client no. HH-2291\nPrepared: IB, 11/18/2025        Reviewed: WT 11/20\n\nRE: Household employer setup -- nanny starting December 1, 2025\n\nEmployer of record will be Rohan Mistry (SSN 528-18-2569); his wife Katrin Falk signs the checks.\nHome: 2214 Asbury Avenue, Evanston, IL 60201. Rohan's cell 847-555-0119, Katrin\n(847) 555-0162, katrin.falk@mailbox.example.\n\nKids: Juno (6, born 4/9/2019) and Emil (3, born 2022-08-30). Juno Mistry-Falk has\ntype 1 diabetes so the nanny does glucose checks -- Katrin wants that written into the work agreement.\nEmil Mistry-Falk is in half-day preschool; dependent care FSA election for 2026 is $5,000 (Form 2441).\n\nEmployee: Marisela Quispe, SSN 516-97-2499, DOB March 3, 1998.\n  1630 W. Lunt Ave., #3B, Chicago, IL 60626     cell 773 555 0144\n  Form I-9 completed 11/17/2025. List A document: EAD card no. SRC2190451177, expires 09/14/2027.\n  She is a DACA recipient, EAD category C33 -- calendar the reverification. Illinois TVDL\n  Q212-5549-8071 seen for the car-insurance rider only, not for the I-9.\n  Form W-4: single, no adjustments. IL-W-4: 1 allowance.\n  Marisela told Katrin she is expecting, due in late March. Not our business for payroll but Katrin\n  asked about leave; told her to talk to an employment lawyer, not us.\n\nWage: $24.00/hr, 45 hrs/wk guaranteed, OT at 1.5 over 40 = $36.00. Gross per week\n$1,140.00. Paid biweekly on Fridays, first check 12/12/25. Year-end bonus of five hundred dollars\npromised in the offer email -- taxable, run through payroll.\n\nRegistrations\n  - Household EIN applied online (Form SS-4) 11/18/2025: 39-4417205\n  - IDES household account (Form UI-HA) 5512889-0, rate letter pending\n  - Illinois withholding: registered under the EIN, seq. 39-4417205-001\n  - Workers' comp rider on the homeowner's policy HO-7720418-03 -- Rohan to confirm with agent\n\nPayroll service: Quince Household Payroll LLC (Quince), plan $49/mo. Login created for Katrin:\nkfalk.household. They file Schedule H figures to us in January and issue the Form W-2.\n\nDirect deposit (voided check on file): Juneberry Community Bank, routing 073809607, checking\n004418207755. Employer debit account is the joint checking ending -6021 at the same bank.\n\nTo-do\n  1. Q4 Form 1040-ES voucher for Rohan needs to go up by about $1,900 to cover employer FICA and FUTA.\n  2. Send Ms. Quispe Publication 926 excerpt and the pay schedule.\n  3. E-Verify not required for household employers -- told Mr. Mistry to stop asking her for more documents.\n\nIfeoma Balogun, CPA  |  ifeoma@balogunthackeray.example  |  312-555-0170 x12\ncc: Wendell Thackeray", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "403 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Rohan Mistry", "Katrin Falk", "Juno Mistry-Falk", "Emil Mistry-Falk", "Marisela Quispe", "Rohan", "Ifeoma Balogun", "Wendell Thackeray"], "companies": ["BALOGUN & THACKERAY CPAs", "Quince Household Payroll LLC", "Juneberry Community Bank", "balogunthackeray"]}, "topics": {"places": [" Evanston, IL", " Chicago, IL", " Evanston", " Chicago"], "health": ["type 1 diabetes", "glucose checks", "preschool"], "sensitive": ["Rohan Mistry", "Katrin Falk", "Marisela Quispe", "DACA recipient", "Illinois TVDL", "leave", "employer lawyer", "expecting"], "names": ["Rohan", "Katrin", "Marisela", "Juno", "Emil", "Ms.", "Wendell", "Ifeoma"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.09999999776482582, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 24, "text": "B